{"name":"Atomic Tangerine","hex":"#ff9966","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"atomic tangerine","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A light orange colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/atomic_tangerine"}],"entries":[{"title":"Atomic Tangerine","blocks":[{"text":"Atomic Tangerine is an American rock band. The band's lineup consists of vocalist/rhythm guitarist Joshua Snyder, lead guitarist Aton Ben-Horin, bassist Jacob Morton, and drummer Mike Rollo."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atomic_Tangerine","wikidata":"Q4817315"},{"title":"Shades of orange","blocks":[{"text":"In optics, orange has a wavelength between approximately 585 and 620 nm and a hue of 30° in HSV color space. In the RGB color space it is a secondary color numerically halfway between gamma-compressed red and yellow, as can be seen in the RGB color wheel. The complementary color of orange is azure. Orange pigments are largely in the ochre or cadmium families, and absorb mostly blue light."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Shades_of_Orange.svg/330px-Shades_of_Orange.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shades_of_orange","wikidata":"Q19847194"},{"title":"Tangerine","blocks":[{"text":"The tangerine is a type of citrus fruit that is orange in colour, that is considered either a variety of the mandarin orange, or a closely related species, under the name Citrus tangerina, or yet as a hybrid of mandarin orange varieties, with some pomelo contribution."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/TangerineFruit.jpg/330px-TangerineFruit.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tangerine","wikidata":"Q516494"},{"title":"Tangerine (color)","blocks":[{"text":"The color tangerine is a tone of orange named after the fruit of the same name."}],"image":"htt